ass="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span># 📊 Amazon Sales Analysis Dashboard

## 📌 Project Overview

This project analyzes Amazon sales data using Microsoft Power BI. The dashboard provides insights into revenue, customer spending, payment methods, order status, and product performance through interactive visualizations.

---

## 🎯 Objective

The objective of this dashboard is to help business users monitor sales performance, identify top customers and products, analyze payment preferences, and track order status for better decision-making.

---

## 🛠️ Tools Used

- Microsoft Power BI
- DAX
- Power Query
- Microsoft Excel
- SQL Server

---

## 📊 Dashboard Features

- 💰 Revenue KPI
- 📦 Total Orders KPI
- 👥 Unique Customers KPI
- 💵 Average Order Value
- ❌ Cancelled Revenue
- ✅ Delivered Revenue
- 🚚 Delivered Orders
- 👑 Top 5 Customers
- 💳 Orders by Payment Method
- 📈 Revenue by Order Status
- 📦 Revenue by Product
- 🌍 State Filter
- 📋 Order Status Filter

---

## 📷 Dashboard Preview

(Add your dashboard screenshot here)

---

## 💡 Key Insights

- Total Revenue: **15M**
- Total Orders: **200**
- Unique Customers: **100**
- Average Order Value: **73.25K**
- UPI is the most frequently used payment method.
- Recent Product generated the highest revenue.
- Shipped orders generated the highest revenue among all order statuses.
- Margaret Livingston is the highest spending customer.

---

## 📂 Dataset

The dataset contains information about:

- Customers
- Products
- Orders
- Payment Methods
- States
- Order Status

---

## 📌 Skills Demonstrated

- Data Cleaning
- Data Modeling
- DAX Measures
- Interactive Dashboard Design
- KPI Development
- Business Insight Generation
- Data Visualization

---

## 👨‍💻 Author

**Anmol Arora**</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
